# =============================================================================
# OMNICODE UNIVERSAL WORLD LEXICON: DOMAIN ONTOLOGY LIVE JOURNAL
# =============================================================================
# @module        OmniCode AI Subsystem: Universal World Lexicon Data
# @file          domain.live.dat
# @layer         Track 1 [Host Engine & Virtual Machine] -> src/ai/lexicon/data
# @version       1.0.0
# @epoch         2026.10
# @author        CreativeWorkzStudio LLC / ProfessorSeanEX
# @role          Append-Only Dynamic Ontological Journal (Living Body Memory)
# @witness       "Write the vision, and make it plain upon tables, that he may
#                 run that readeth it." — Habakkuk 2:2 (KJV)
#
# PURPOSE & ARCHITECTURAL PHILOSOPHY:
#   In OmniCode, "Learning is in the BODY (filesystem), not the WEIGHTS (model)".
#   While `domain.base.dat` contains the immutable primordial baseline of the
#   15 Sovereign Domains, this live journal records newly learned categories,
#   subdomains, specialized subcategories, and Operator-directed expansions.
#
# INVARIANTS:
#   1. APPEND-ONLY: Existing lines must never be overwritten or deleted.
#   2. NON-CONFLICT: Appended subdomains must conform to the 15 Sovereign
#      Domains and maintain valid parent-child ontological contracts.
#   3. TRIPWIRES: Corrupted lines are quarantined without halting the engine.
#
# FORMAT:
#   SUBDOMAIN|<id>|<category_id>|<domain_id>|<rank>|<quad_state>|<title>|<system_scope>|<normative_rule>
#   SUBCATEGORY|<id>|<subdomain_id>|<title>|<description>
#   CONCEPT|<id>|<subdomain_id>|<title>|<definition>
#   ENTITY|<id>|<subdomain_id>|<denotation>|<what_it_is>
#   OPERATION|<id>|<free_standing_action>|<directional_vector>|<purpose>
# =============================================================================

